{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter the post-apocalyptic world as a pilot in this intense top-down action roguelike. Command your customizable combat mech through bullet-hell battles while managing crucial systems like power distribution and heat levels. Each run presents unique challenges and opportunities as you collect relics that can dramatically alter your vehicle's capabilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deep Customization: Modify your vehicle with interchangeable parts including weapons, shields, coolers, power reactors, and hover pads</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic Power Management: Balance your vehicle's energy distribution and heat levels across systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roguelike Elements: Discover and collect relics that provide unique buffs and debuffs, making each run different</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategic Combat: Engage in tactical battles combining vehicular combat with bullet-hell elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Advanced Power Control: Fine-tune power allocation to different systems for optimal performance</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3351400?t=1739892866","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351400/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1739892866","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351400/92d985c2e5def056aafd27f4a7430f85d95ced70/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739892866","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351400/92d985c2e5def056aafd27f4a7430f85d95ced70/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739892866","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full cont